<title>USA: First Industrial enters Cleveland market.</title>
<headline>First Industrial enters Cleveland market.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Monday it had entered the Cleveland and northeastern Ohio industrial real estate market and intends to invest about $50 million there over the next 18 months.</p>
<p>Earlier this year First Industrial said it had entered the Indianapolis, Cincinnati and Columbus markets.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
